{"n": 107, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "107.webp", "text": "2011126\n\nbe.\n\npar\n\nDisconnect water hoses for heater\n\nPress down on breather pipe and lock with\nSpecial Tool 11 1 290.\n\nInstallation:\n\nCheck seal, replacing if necessary.\n\nCheck for correct seating of breather pipe\nafter removal of Special Tool 11 1 290.\n\nPull off ignition leads on ignition coil.\nRemove fan — see 11 52 000.\n\nUnscrew water pipe mounting bolts (1 and 2)\nand sake off water pipe.\n\nRemove cylinder head cover — see 11 12 000.\n\nSet cylinder no, 1 to TDC by turning crank-\nshaft (valves of cylinder no. 6 overlap).\n\nUnscrew distributor cap (1)\nUnscrew distributor rotor (2)\nRemove cover (3)\n\nUnscrew bolts (4).\n\nUnscrew nut (5).\n\nRemove protective cover (6)\nTake off clip underneath distributor and place\nelectric leads in front of pulley.\nInstallation;\n\nScrew on holder (7).\n\nChock rubber ring (8).\n\nInsert rubber cover (9).\n\nLoosen bolts (7 and 8).\nPress in tensioning roller.\nTighten bolt (8).\n\nTake toothed drive belt off of camshaft sprocket\nCaution!\n\nNever crank engine afte? removing belt,\nfastallation.\n\nAlways replace an used toothed drive belt after\nloosening, regardless of the mileage***\n\nReplace toothed drive belt - see 1131 110.\n\nJastallation:\n\nTurn in camshaft prior to mounting the cylinder\nhead in such a manner, that mark on camshaft\nsprocket points to mark on cylinder head.\nCylinder no. 1 is in TOC.\n\nMount the toothed drive belt in this position.\n\n*** See Service Information of Group 11", "words": [["2011126", 0.1976, 0.5086, 0.2351, 0.5172], ["be.", 0.1272, 0.6034, 0.1829, 0.6824], ["par", 0.1261, 0.6903, 0.1849, 0.7268], ["Disconnect", 0.2609, 0.069, 0.3131, 0.0789], ["water", 0.3171, 0.071, 0.3425, 0.0789], ["hoses", 0.347, 0.069, 0.3718, 0.0789], ["for", 0.3754, 0.069, 0.388, 0.0796], ["heater", 0.3926, 0.0696, 0.4205, 0.0796], ["Press", 0.2604, 0.3017, 0.2837, 0.3123], ["down", 0.2867, 0.3024, 0.3131, 0.313], ["on", 0.